abstract: >
  KTP Origin Audit Examples v0.1 provides example origin-audit
  records for applying the KTP Trace Intelligence Specification to
  explicit citation, implicit absorption, blended influence, disputed
  trace claims, and allocation-readiness review scenarios. The examples
  demonstrate how possible origin relationships can be documented safely
  without making final origin judgments or triggering automatic royalty
  allocation.

keywords:
